    "仅 Wi-Fi · 私有 IPv4 / 链路本地地址 · 最多 1024 个地址。扫描时自动排除本机地址。更换 Wi-Fi 后请确认扫描范围。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi only · private IPv4 / link-local addresses · up to 1,024 addresses. This device's address is excluded automatically. After switching Wi-Fi, check the scan range."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅 Wi-Fi · 私有 IPv4 / 链路本地地址 · 最多 1024 个地址。扫描时自动排除本机地址。更换 Wi-Fi 后请确认扫描范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅保存在本机，保留最近 30 次扫描。向左滑动可删除记录。" : {
